,1965,62,87,18]],"links":[["Worcester County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/massachusetts/worcester-county"],["ARC or PLC in Worcester County","/arc-plc/massachusetts/worcester-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 that pair landed at 69% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 62% and May to June at 79% on the middle of the grids. Every grid shows 1965 as its driest year, with grid 26635 at 58%.</p>"}
